{"parse":{"title":"List of U.S. states and territories by African-American population","pageid":20010164,"redirects":[{"from":"List of U.S. states by African-American population","to":"List of U.S. states and territories by African-American population"}],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:African_Americans_by_state.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9e/African_Americans_by_state.svg/960px-African_Americans_by_state.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"550\" height=\"272\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9e/African_Americans_by_state.svg/1280px-African_Americans_by_state.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1199\" data-file-height=\"593\" /></a><figcaption><div style=\"text-align: center\">Proportion of African Americans in each U.S. state, the District of Columbia, and Puerto Rico as of the 2020 United States Census</div></figcaption></figure>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Black_Americans_by_county.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Black_Americans_by_county.png/960px-Black_Americans_by_county.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"550\" height=\"293\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Black_Americans_by_county.png/1280px-Black_Americans_by_county.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"7500\" data-file-height=\"4000\" /></a><figcaption><div style=\"text-align: center\">Proportion of <a href=\"/wiki/Black_Americans\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Black Americans\">black Americans</a> in each county of the <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_states_and_territories_of_the_United_States\" title=\"List of states and territories of the United States\">fifty states</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/District_of_Columbia\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"District of Columbia\">District of Columbia</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Puerto_Rico\" title=\"Puerto Rico\">Puerto Rico</a> as of the <a href=\"/wiki/2020_United_States_Census\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2020 United States Census\">2020 United States Census</a></div></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The following is a list of <a href=\"/wiki/U.S._state\" title=\"U.S. state\">U.S. states</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Territories_of_the_United_States\" title=\"Territories of the United States\">territories</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/District_of_Columbia\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"District of Columbia\">District of Columbia</a> ranked by the proportion of <a href=\"/wiki/African_American\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"African American\">African Americans</a> of full or partial descent, including those of Hispanic origin, in the population. Considering only those who marked \"black\" and no other race in combination, as in the first table, the percentage was 12.4% in 2020, down from 12.6% in 2010.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> While those who selected black and any other race in combination was 14.2%.\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"2020_census_(single_race)\"><span id=\"2020_census_.28single_race.29\"></span>2020 census (single race)</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=List_of_U.S._states_and_territories_by_African-American_population&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: 2020 census (single race)\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"sortable wikitable\">\n\n<tbody><tr style=\"background:#ececec;\">\n<th>% Black or African<br />American alone or in combination<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</th>\n<th>Rank\n</th>\n<th>State or territory\n</th>\n<th>Black or African American alone or in combination<br />Population  (2020)\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">76.0%\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span data-sort-value=\"7000100000000000000♠\">1</span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/United_States_Virgin_Islands\" title=\"United States Virgin Islands\"><img alt=\"United States Virgin Islands\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f8/Flag_of_the_United_States_Virgin_Islands.svg/40px-Flag_of_the_United_States_Virgin_Islands.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f8/Flag_of_the_United_States_Virgin_Islands.svg/60px-Flag_of_the_United_States_Virgin_Islands.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1275\" data-file-height=\"850\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/U.S._Virgin_Islands\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"U.S. Virgin Islands\">Virgin Islands (U.S.)</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">80,908<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-USVI&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-USVI-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">41.41%\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span data-sort-value=\"7000200000000000000♠\">2</span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Flag_of_Washington%2C_D.C.svg/40px-Flag_of_Washington%2C_D.C.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"23\" height=\"12\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Flag_of_Washington%2C_D.C.svg/60px-Flag_of_Washington%2C_D.C.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2000\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></span></span> </span><a href=\"/wiki/Washington,_D.C.\" title=\"Washington, D.C.\">District of Columbia</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">285,810\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">37.94%\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span data-sort-value=\"7000300000000000000♠\">3</span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/42/Flag_of_Mississippi.svg/40px-Flag_of_Mississippi.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"23\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/42/Flag_of_Mississippi.svg/60px-Flag_of_Mississippi.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1200\" data-file-height=\"720\" /></span></span> </span><a href=\"/wiki/Mississippi\" title=\"Mississippi\">Mississippi</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">1,084,481\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:right;\">33.13%\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span data-sort-value=\"7000400000000